  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様、咲耶！\r\nイベント、すっごく盛り上がっていたな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あぁ……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あ、すまない！\r\nええっと……どうしたんだい、プロデューサー？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫か？\r\nどこか具合でも悪いんじゃ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いや、大丈夫だよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それならいいんだが……\r\n体調が悪い時はすぐに言ってくれよ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "心配をかけてしまって悪かったね\r\nこの通りなんとも……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………\r\n……いや……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね、なんともない……わけじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……咲耶？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ねぇ、プロデューサー\r\n……私の隣に、座ってくれないかい？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、わかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（改まってどうしたんだろう？\r\n何か大事な話でもあるのか……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ええと、次は……肩に、頭を預けてもいいかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110110"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
