    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと、これは一体……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "その……私自身が、望むことを\r\nやってみようかと思って……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charId": "C",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それで……その……",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "すまない……迷惑、だったかな……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなことはないぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それなら、よかった……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "肩を貸すことは、女の子相手にはあるのだけど\r\n自分が借りるのは、初めてなんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "イベントを終えて、ふっと息をついて……\r\n今日のイベントはとても楽しんでもらえたと思い返して……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうしたら、なぜか、アナタに肩を借りたいと思った",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "自分がこんなことをしたいと考えるなんて、\r\n思ってもなかったのだけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど……確かにこれは……\r\nとても安らいだ気持ちになれるものだね",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……勇気を出してお願いしてよかったよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ\r\n咲耶がしたいことを手伝えて、俺も嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。本当にアナタは優しいね\r\n…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110230"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ねぇ、プロデューサー。私という個人がしたいこと……\r\nまだ、あまり多くは浮かばないんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "やはり私は……私のファンや、友達や\r\nみんなが喜んでもらえることをするのが、好きだからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも、もしも自分自身が心から望むことができた時は……\r\n今みたいに勇気を出して、やってみようと思うんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。その時は俺にも手伝わせてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の中に芽生える願いが何か、まだわからないけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600611/2006006110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006110290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "きっとアナタとなら、叶えられる気がするよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
